# Progressive data expansion schedule:
#   (max_epoch_exclusive, num_train_pairs)
#   epochs 0-5:  10 pairs
#   epochs 6-10:  50 pairs
#   epochs 11-15: 100 pairs
#   epochs 16+:  all available pairs
